   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forum Syd Ignalina</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Forum Syd Ignalina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A special programme set up by Sida in order to promote and stimulate the co-operation between non-governmental organisations in Sweden and in the &quot;Ignalina-region&quot; in Lithuania. Forum Syd, a Swedish umbrella organisation for NGOs, is selected as co-ordinating and implementing party of the programme.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;len med insatsen &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja det civila samh&#xe4;llet i &quot;Ignalina-omr&#xe5;det&quot; samt att bidra till att minska de negativa social effekterna av nedl&#xe4;ggningen av INPP.</narrative>
  </description>
